#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "</details>\n"
#| "Generate entire error-mitigated quasi-probability distributions sampled from quantum circuit outputs. Leverage Sampler’s capabilities for search and classification algorithms like Grover’s and QVSM.\n"
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Generate entire error-mitigated quasi-probability distributions sampled from quantum circuit outputs. Leverage Sampler’s capabilities for search and classification algorithms like Grover’s and QVSM.\n"
msgstr ""
"</details>\n"
"Hasilkan distribusi quasi-probability bermitigasi error lengkap yang diambil sampel dari output quantum circuit. Manfaatkan kemampuan Sampler untuk algoritma pencarian dan klasifikasi seperti Grover dan QVSM.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run a single experiment {#run-a-single-experiment}"
msgstr "Jalankan satu eksperimen {#run-a-single-experiment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Sampler to return the measurement outcome as bitstrings or counts of a single circuit.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan Sampler untuk mengembalikan hasil pengukuran sebagai bitstring atau hitungan dari satu circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run multiple experiments in a single job {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-single-job}"
msgstr "Jalankan beberapa eksperimen dalam satu job {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-single-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Sampler to return the measurement outcome as bitstrings or counts of multiple circuits in one job.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan Sampler untuk mengembalikan hasil pengukuran sebagai bitstring atau hitungan dari beberapa circuit dalam satu job.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run parameterized circuits {#run-parameterized-circuits}"
msgstr "Jalankan circuit berparameter {#run-parameterized-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run several experiments in a single job, leveraging parameter values to increase circuit reusability.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan beberapa eksperimen dalam satu job, manfaatkan nilai parameter untuk meningkatkan reusabilitas circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use batches and advanced options {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"
msgstr "Gunakan batch dan opsi lanjutan {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore the batch [execution mode](/guides/execution-modes) and advanced options to optimize circuit performance on QPUs.\n"
msgstr "Jelajahi [mode eksekusi](/guides/execution-modes) batch dan opsi lanjutan untuk mengoptimalkan performa circuit di QPU.\n"

