msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Specify advanced runtime options](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile/) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings) guide.\n"
"- Understand the [Job limits](/guides/job-limits) when sending a job to an IBM&reg; QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- [Tentukan opsi runtime lanjutan](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Berlatih dengan primitif dengan mengerjakan [pelajaran Cost function](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) di IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Pelajari cara transpile secara lokal di bagian [Transpile](/guides/transpile/).\n"
"- Coba panduan [Bandingkan pengaturan transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings).\n"
"- Baca [Migrasi ke primitif V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Pahami [Batas job](/guides/job-limits) saat mengirim job ke QPU IBM&reg;.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
